<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60613" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυκλ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wind round</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τὸν περινεὸν κ. τὸ ὀθόνιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>traverse</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μιᾶς ἡμέρας κ. περίοδον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					6.3.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				9.3.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				2.530
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Puteoli</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥλιος κ.</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν γῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cleom.
					1.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>work a water-wheel,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PLond.
				1.131.495
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>irrigate by means of a water-wheel,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PGrenf.
				1.58.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>circumvent, surround</i>, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>BC</u>
				4.71
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
